      "title": "feat: add todo statistics endpoint and progress display",
      "body": "## Requirements\n- REQ-01: Added `GET /api/todos/stats` endpoint returning `{ total, completed, open }` based on the current todos array.\n- REQ-02: Added a `<p id=\"progress\" role=\"status\">` element to the page; `fetchTodos()` now also fetches stats and sets its `textContent` to `${completed} of ${total} done`, updating on every add, toggle, and delete.\n\n## Testing\nRan `npm test` in `app/` — all 11 tests pass (9 existing + 2 new stats tests):\n- `GET /api/todos/stats returns total, completed, and open counts`\n- `GET /api/todos/stats reflects current todo state`\n\nResults: 11 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped.",
